지혜의 문'과 '재물의 문', 베트남 전쟁 희생자를 기리기 위한 거대한 해수관음상 및 다양한 불교 예술품을 감상할 수 있습니다.","pkgCmsImgInfoList":null,"cntntCardGrpId":null,"chcStsngCd":null,"cmsSpclStsngYn":"N","extriStsngYn":null,"vhcwndStsngYn":null}],"meetingPlaceKindCode":null,"representativePlaceYn":null,"gpsLatitude":null,"gpsLongitude":null,"address":null,"detailAddress":null},{"schtExprSqc":5,"schdCatgCd":"001","schdCatgNm":"관광지","schdRqrmTm":"0","schdRqrmHm":"0","memoTitlNm":null,"memoCont":null,"extriStsngYn":"N","vhcwndStsngYn":"N","cmsCardId":"20161027049449","dtlMealDvNm":null,"mealTypeNm":null,"mealTypeCd":null,"mealCont":null,"depCityCd":null,"depCityNm":null,"arrCityCd":null,"arriveCityNm":null,"cardMainCd":null,"cardNm":"코코넛 수용소","bndlCardYn":null,"chcStsngCd":null,"cardCntntTitlNm":null,"schdDay":4,"airCityExprYn":"Y","cmsCardDvCd":"S","cardCntnt":null,"cardCntntPc":"<div class=\"card_mngr\">\n    <div class=\"card_unit type3\">\n        <div class=\"_tit title\"><strong class=\"eps\">코코넛 수용소</strong><a href=\"#\" class=\"txt detail pk\" c_code=\"P000296284\" chc_stsng_code=\"\">상세보기</a></div>\n        <div class=\"_tit_comt sub\"><p class=\"eps\">베트남 현대사의 살아있는 유적</p></div>\n        <div class=\"_info_section cont_box\">\n            <div class=\"_thumb thumb\"><div class=\"swiper-container img_tit prevNext pager\"><div class=\"swiper-wrapper\"><div class=\"swiper-slide movie_box\">\n <img src=\"https://image.hanatour.com/usr/cms/resize/400_0/2019/01/03/10000/8cf651f3-b541-4dd3-8528-4fe0eda34167.jpg\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://image.hanatour.com/usr/cms/resize/400_0/2022/08/23/10000/7c92f812-d6b5-4660-94aa-4f8b95d1719c.jpg\" alt=\"푸꾸옥수용소\"><img src=\"https://image.hanatour.com/usr/cms/resize/400_0/2016/10/26/10000/55f0138d-7372-476d-a0ca-786b3970454e.jpg\" alt=\"코코넛수용소\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide movie_box\">\n <img src=\"https://image.hanatour.com/usr/cms/resize/400_0/2022/08/23/10000/55a47693-9ce6-4864-a64b-ca2d9e4ffc76.jpg\" alt=\"푸꾸옥수용소\"><img src=\"https://image.hanatour.com/usr/cms/resize/400_0/2022/08/23/10000/9faca490-9c35-4979-8d30-7ba786b3c628.jpg\" alt=\"푸꾸옥수용소\"><img src=\"https://image.hanatour.com/usr/cms/resize/400_0/2022/08/23/10000/7c56b6d4-cfa9-495b-8271-9fcc04458bfa.jpg\" alt=\"푸꾸옥수용소\">\n</div></div><div class=\"controller\"><span class=\"total\"></span><a href=\"#none\" class=\"prev\"><span class=\"blind\">이전</span></a><a href=\"#none\" class=\"next\"><span class=\"blind\">다음</span></a></div></div></div>\n            <div class=\"_txt_cont txt_conts\"><div>정식 명칭은 푸꾸옥 수용소로 베트남 전쟁 당시 공산군을 수용한 곳입니다.  수용소 내부에는 당시 포로들의 수감생활을 실감 나게 재현해두었으며, 수용소 건물 맞은편 추모관에서는 수감자의 넋을 기리고 있습니다. 전쟁의 잔혹함과 슬픈 역사를 생생히 느낄 수 있는 장소로 베트남 현대사의 살아있는 유적입니다.\n</div></div>\n            <div class=\"_local_info txt_box disc\"></div>\n            \n            <div class=\"custom_tag_a\"><div class=\"lead_time\"><div class=\"time\"></div><div class=\"tour\"></div></div></div>\n        </div>\n        <hr class=\"line_white\">\n        <div class=\"custom_tag_b\"><div class=\"card_notice\"> \r\n  <div class=\"\"><!--custTitle--></div> \r\n  <div class=\"notice_cont\"><!--custMemo--></div> \r\n</div></div>\n    </div>\n</div>","cardCntntMbl":"<div class=\"card_mngr type3\">\n    <div class=\"card_unit\">\n        <div class=\"_thumb thumb img3\"><div class=\"scroll_box\">\n<span class=\"img_box\"><img src=\"https://image.hanatour.com/usr/cms/resize/400_0/2019/01/03/10000/8cf651f3-b541-4dd3-8528-4fe0eda34167.jpg\" alt=\"\"></span>\n<span class=\"img_box\"><img src=\"https://image.hanatour.com/usr/cms/resize/400_0/2022/08/23/10000/7c92f812-d6b5-4660-94aa-4f8b95d1719c.jpg\" alt=\"푸꾸옥수용소\"></span>\n<span class=\"img_box\"><img src=\"https://image.hanatour.com/usr/cms/resize/400_0/2016/10/26/10000/55f0138d-7372-476d-a0ca-786b3970454e.jpg\" alt=\"코코넛수용소\"></span>\n<span class=\"img_box\"><img src=\"https://image.hanatour.com/usr/cms/resize/400_0/2022/08/23/10000/55a47693-9ce6-4864-a64b-ca2d9e4ffc76.jpg\" alt=\"푸꾸옥수용소\"></span>\n<span class=\"img_box\"><img src=\"https://imag